    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U04_PT_Q06</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.FN.3</p><p>A graph crosses the x-axis at x=8. What feature is x=8?</p>]]></text>
